      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BOGIE PRIDE (4) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by half a length at Capalaba in a handy 20.09 beating Rain About. The form out of his last race has been franked. The hardest to beat again. NAME OF LOVE (2) is racing well without winning, recording six minors on end, the latest hitting the ground running with a fast early sectional but finishing in the minors again when second (19.12) over 350m at this track. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Bold showing expected. LITTLE HOUSE (7) was out of the placings last time but before that was an impressive winner (19.63) in a Grade 4 at Q Lakeside. Expected to bounce back to best. LOST DRAGON (3) can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
